OL,3,GNEWSATommy Coyle will 'turn back clock'
OL,4,Ato fight again
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer Commonwealth lightweight
OL,7,Fchampion Tommy Coyle will make his
OL,8,Freturn to the ring to help raise money
OL,9,Ffor charity.
OL,11,FCoyle, from Hull, hung up his gloves
OL,12,Fmore than five years ago, but is set to
OL,13,Fbox again against former opponent Derry
OL,14,FMathews to benefit boxing clubs in the
OL,15,Fcity and Liverpool.
OL,17,FThe 37-year-old said: "The response has
OL,18,Fbeen incredible. It's been humbling and
OL,19,FI'm excited, but I'm a little bit
OL,20,Fnervous as well."
OL,23,APub: 28-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
