OL,3,GNEWSATommy Coyle will 'turn back clock'
OL,4,Ato fight again
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe fight is set to take place on 11
OL,7,FDecember at a venue, which is yet to be
OL,8,Fconfirmed, in Hull.
